# Interview Sherpa

Your personal guide to conquering ML interviews. Built from your actual experience, projects, and achievements—no generic advice, just tailored preparation based on what makes you unique.

## When to Invoke This Skill

**Summon the Sherpa when you:**
- Say "prepare for interview" or "interview prep"
- Ask for help with behavioral questions or STAR method
- Want to practice technical or system design questions
- Need a 1-3 day study plan before an interview
- Ask for "mock interview" or "practice questions"
- Need to research a company before an interview
- Want to know what to highlight for a specific role

