## Phase 2: Know Your Stories

### Your 6 STAR Stories (Ready to Use)

#### 1. Config Refactoring → Scalability & Leadership
> "I decoupled our tightly-coupled configuration system, making it modular and scalable. Proposed changes, got team alignment, implemented across multiple Jira tickets. Result: easier to add configs, reduced technical debt."

#### 2. Azure Migration → MLOps & Infrastructure
> "Migrated ML training infrastructure from local to Azure cloud. Designed architecture with VMs, Blob Storage, distributed training. Result: eliminated resource contention, enabled larger models, faster dev cycles."

#### 3. InPlay Model → Efficiency & Optimization
> "Built binary classifier to detect in-play vs out-of-play game states. Achieved >95% accuracy with <10ms inference. Result: 30-40% computational waste reduction."

#### 4. Precommit Hooks → Team Productivity
> "Implemented precommit hooks to auto-clean Jupyter notebooks (strip outputs, remove debug prints). Reduced code review time, enforced consistency."

#### 5. Events Model → Complex ML Problem
> "Built real-time pass event detection model for football. Multi-task architecture, >90% precision, >85% recall, <100ms latency. Enabled passing networks analytics."

#### 6. Focal Loss Optimization → Data-Driven Rigor
> "Improved model confidence through systematic experimentation. Tested 8 approaches (Temperature Scaling, Focal Loss, Weighted BCE). Achieved 90.5% of positives above 0.9 threshold."

